{"content":{"title":"Accueil","sharer":{"title":"Partager","links":{"facebook":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/sharer.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Frecrutement.natixis.com%2Fapp%2F","linkedin":"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/shareArticle?url=https%3A%2F%2Frecrutement.natixis.com%2Fapp%2F&title=Accueil+-+Recrutement+Natixis","mail":"mailto:?subject=Accueil%20-%20Recrutement%20Natixis&body=Check%20out%20this%20site:%20https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/app\/"}},"visuel":{"src":"https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/app\/assets-bpce\/uploads\/sites\/17\/2023\/03\/header.jpg","alt":""},"media_height":"","media_keep_ratio":false,"introduction":"","flexibles":[{"_uid":"3f0363a705f0c","bloc":"bloc_wysiwyg","datas":{"text":"<div class=\"texte-intro\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center\">#TransformativeFinance<\/h2>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"surligne\">Rejoignez-nous<\/span><br \/>\npour faire la diff\u00e9rence<\/h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\"><a class=\"bouton\" href=\"https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/nos-offres-demploi?external=false\">D\u00e9couvrez nos offres<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n"}},{"_uid":"68b96ab0b3784","bloc":"bloc_sectors","datas":{"title":"Des m\u00e9tiers tourn\u00e9s vers l'avenir","list":[{"image":{"src":"https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/app\/assets-bpce\/uploads\/sites\/17\/2023\/03\/metiers-corporate-investment-banking.jpg","alt":"Metiers Corporate Investment Banking"},"title":"Corporate and Investment Banking","excerpt":"En tant qu'institution financi\u00e8re mondiale de premier plan, nous mettons \u00e0 disposition de nos clients - entreprises, institutions financi\u00e8res, sponsors financiers, souverains et supranationaux -  une large palette de services.","link":{"url":"\/sector\/corporate-investment-banking","title":"Corporate and Investment Banking","target":"_self","internal":true}},{"image":{"src":"https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/app\/assets-bpce\/uploads\/sites\/17\/2023\/03\/metiers-gestion-actifs-fortune.jpg","alt":"Metiers Gestion Actifs Fortune"},"title":"Gestion d\u2019actifs et de fortune","excerpt":"Nous sommes un acteur mondial de premier rang, dot\u00e9 d\u2019un mod\u00e8le multi-affili\u00e9s performant avec une distribution centralis\u00e9e et g\u00e9n\u00e9rateur de valeur ajout\u00e9e pour les clients investisseurs et partenaires.","link":{"url":"\/sector\/gestion-dactifs-et-de-fortune","title":"Gestion d\u2019actifs et de fortune","target":"_self","internal":true}},{"image":{"src":"https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/app\/assets-bpce\/uploads\/sites\/17\/2023\/03\/metiers-gestion-operations.jpg","alt":"Metiers Gestion Operations"},"title":"Gestion des op\u00e9rations","excerpt":"Notre \u00e9quipe de Global Markets Operations vous accueille en tant que gestionnaire d'op\u00e9rations de march\u00e9 \/ r\u00e8glement-livraison de titres.\r\n","link":{"url":"\/sector\/gestion-des-operations","title":"Gestion des op\u00e9rations","target":"_self","internal":true}},{"image":{"src":"https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/app\/assets-bpce\/uploads\/sites\/17\/2021\/10\/metiers-audit-interne.jpg","alt":"Metiers Audit Interne"},"title":"Audit interne","excerpt":"La mission du service d'audit interne est d'assurer l'efficacit\u00e9 des processus de contr\u00f4le interne, d'identifier les risques et les points d'am\u00e9lioration, et de recommander des solutions pour renforcer les pratiques de gestion des risques et de conformit\u00e9 r\u00e9glementaire. Et ce en toute ind\u00e9pendance.","link":{"url":"\/sector\/audit-interne","title":"Audit interne","target":"_self","internal":true}},{"image":{"src":"https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/app\/assets-bpce\/uploads\/sites\/17\/2021\/10\/engineering.jpg","alt":"Engineering"},"title":"Tech &amp; Innovation","excerpt":"L'IT au service de la finance, faites que votre talent et votre expertise aient un r\u00e9el impact !","link":{"url":"\/sector\/tech-innovation","title":"Tech & Innovation","target":"_self","internal":true}},{"image":{"src":"https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/app\/assets-bpce\/uploads\/sites\/17\/2021\/10\/digital-marketing.jpg","alt":"Digital Marketing"},"title":"Compliance","excerpt":"La Fili\u00e8re Compliance joue un r\u00f4le crucial dans la protection de notre r\u00e9putation et de notre s\u00e9curit\u00e9 en veillant \u00e0 ce que toutes nos activit\u00e9s respectent les lois et les r\u00e9glementations en vigueur.","link":{"url":"\/sector\/compliance","title":"Compliance","target":"_self","internal":true}},{"image":{"src":"https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/app\/assets-bpce\/uploads\/sites\/17\/2023\/03\/metiers-risques.jpg","alt":"Metiers Risques"},"title":"Risques","excerpt":"La fili\u00e8re Risques est au c\u0153ur de nos enjeux strat\u00e9giques et op\u00e9rationnels. Elle accompagne au quotidien la direction g\u00e9n\u00e9rale et l\u2019ensemble de nos m\u00e9tiers dans un r\u00f4le de conseil, de suivi et de contr\u00f4le face aux risques multiples et changeants auxquels ils sont expos\u00e9s (risques de march\u00e9, de cr\u00e9dit, op\u00e9rationnels, climatiques, etc.).","link":{"url":"\/sector\/risques","title":"Risques","target":"_self","internal":true}},{"image":{"src":"https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/app\/assets-bpce\/uploads\/sites\/17\/2023\/03\/metiers-juridique-02.jpg","alt":"Metiers Juridique 02"},"title":"Juridique","excerpt":"La fili\u00e8re Juridique participe, aux c\u00f4t\u00e9s de l\u2019ensemble des m\u00e9tiers et fili\u00e8res, \u00e0 la d\u00e9finition et \u00e0 la r\u00e9alisation des objectifs strat\u00e9giques et op\u00e9rationnels de l\u2019entreprise, dont elle est un acteur \u00e0 part enti\u00e8re.","link":{"url":"\/sector\/juridique","title":"Juridique","target":"_self","internal":true}},{"image":{"src":"https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/app\/assets-bpce\/uploads\/sites\/17\/2023\/03\/metiers-finance.jpg","alt":"Metiers Finance"},"title":"Finance et comptabilit\u00e9","excerpt":"Notre \u00e9quipe Finance et comptabilit\u00e9 a pour mission de veiller \u00e0 la bonne gestion financi\u00e8re de l'entreprise en assurant la tenue de la comptabilit\u00e9, la production d'\u00e9tats ","link":{"url":"\/sector\/finance-comptabilite","title":"Finance et comptabilit\u00e9","target":"_self","internal":true}},{"image":{"src":"https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/app\/assets-bpce\/uploads\/sites\/17\/2023\/03\/metiers-organisation.jpg","alt":"Metiers Organisation"},"title":"Strategy &amp; Transformation","excerpt":"Notre service Strategy &amp; Transformation a pour mission d'accompagner nos m\u00e9tiers dans leurs projets de transformation et d'optimisation de leur performance. Il propose une expertise sur mesure pour piloter les phases amont des projets, structurer les d\u00e9marches, d\u00e9finir les objectifs, et r\u00e9aliser des plans d'actions adapt\u00e9s aux besoins de chaque m\u00e9tier.","link":{"url":"\/sector\/strategy-transformation","title":"Strategy & Transformation","target":"_self","internal":true}},{"image":{"src":"https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/app\/assets-bpce\/uploads\/sites\/17\/2023\/03\/metiers-RH.jpg","alt":"Metiers Rh"},"title":"Ressources Humaines","excerpt":"V\u00e9ritable moteur des comp\u00e9tences et des forces vives de nos m\u00e9tiers, les Ressources Humaines occupent une fonction cl\u00e9 pour la r\u00e9ussite de notre entreprise. Ancr\u00e9es dans le relationnel, elles accompagnent les m\u00e9tiers dans leurs projets de transformation et les\u00e9quipes dans leur d\u00e9veloppement professionnel, au regard des \u00e9volutions du march\u00e9.","link":{"url":"\/sector\/ressources-humaines","title":"Ressources Humaines","target":"_self","internal":true}},{"image":{"src":"https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/app\/assets-bpce\/uploads\/sites\/17\/2023\/03\/metiers-communication.jpg","alt":"Metiers Communication"},"title":"Communication","excerpt":"Notre fili\u00e8re Communication a pour mission de d\u00e9velopper et mettre en \u0153uvre notre communication interne et externe.\r\nLes \u00e9quipes Communication travaillent en \u00e9troite collaboration avec l'ensemble des m\u00e9tiers pour concevoir et d\u00e9ployer des plans de communication efficaces qui r\u00e9pondent \u00e0 leurs enjeux.","link":{"url":"\/sector\/communication","title":"Communication","target":"_self","internal":true}}]}},{"_uid":"9e0457984697e","bloc":"bloc_wysiwyg","datas":{"text":"<div class=\"metiers-mondiaux\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center\">Les m\u00e9tiers mondiaux du Groupe BPCE<\/h2>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone\" src=\"https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/app\/assets-bpce\/uploads\/sites\/17\/2026\/02\/map-metiers-fr.png\" alt=\"Am\u00e9rique : 3 000 collaborateurs ; EMEA : 11 500 collaborateurs ; APAC : +1 200 collaborateurs\" width=\"1300\" height=\"824\" \/><\/p>\n<p><strong>Choisissez l\u2019axe de la transformation durable et de la finance qui change le monde. En nous rejoignant, vous r\u00e9pondrez concr\u00e8tement aux enjeux environnementaux, technologiques et soci\u00e9taux de notre \u00e9poque.<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\"metiers-mondiaux\">\n<div class=\"colonnes deux half invert\">\n<div class=\"colonne\">\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone\" src=\"https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/app\/assets-bpce\/uploads\/sites\/17\/2023\/03\/logo-natixis-corporate.png\" alt=\"Natixis Corporate and Investment Banking\" width=\"235\" height=\"64\" \/><\/p>\n<h3>Une banque de grande client\u00e8le reconnue pour ses expertises et sa capacit\u00e9 d\u2019innovation<\/h3>\n<p>Un acteur majeur de la finance de dimension internationale, qui met \u00e0 disposition de ses clients une palette de services en conseil, investment banking, financements, banque commerciale et sur les march\u00e9s de capitaux.<br \/>\n<a class=\"bouton\" href=\"https:\/\/cib.natixis.com\/Home\/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Voir le site<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"colonne\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/app\/assets-bpce\/uploads\/sites\/17\/2023\/03\/corporate-investment-banking.jpg\" \/><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\"colonnes deux half\">\n<div class=\"colonne\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/app\/assets-bpce\/uploads\/sites\/17\/2023\/03\/investment-managers.jpg\" \/><\/div>\n<div class=\"colonne\">\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone\" src=\"https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/app\/assets-bpce\/uploads\/sites\/17\/2023\/03\/logo-natixis-investment-managers.png\" alt=\"Natixis Investment Managers\" width=\"232\" height=\"51\" \/><\/p>\n<h3>Un leader mondial de la gestion d&rsquo;actifs<\/h3>\n<p>Un acteur mondial de premier rang, dot\u00e9 d\u2019un mod\u00e8le multi-affili\u00e9s performant avec une distribution centralis\u00e9e, et g\u00e9n\u00e9rateur de valeur ajout\u00e9e pour ses clients investisseurs et partenaires.<br \/>\n<a class=\"bouton\" href=\"https:\/\/www.im.natixis.com\/fr\/accueil\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Voir le site<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"colonnes trois\" style=\"margin-top: 100px\">\n<div class=\"colonne\">Une communaut\u00e9 de <span class=\"surligne\">+ 14 000<\/span> collaborateurs<\/div>\n<div class=\"colonne\">Une pr\u00e9sence dans pr\u00e8s de <span class=\"surligne\">40<\/span> pays<\/div>\n<div class=\"colonne\">Un \u00e9cosyst\u00e8me de pr\u00e8s de <span class=\"surligne\">40<\/span> entit\u00e9s<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n"}},{"_uid":"4c00f25dbcca4","bloc":"bloc_carrousel","datas":{"title":" ","carousel":[{"image":{"src":"https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/app\/assets-bpce\/uploads\/sites\/17\/2023\/03\/entite-natixis-AWM-1.png","alt":"Lien pour acc\u00e9der au site de Natixis Wealth Management"},"link":{"url":"https:\/\/www.wealthmanagement.natixis.com\/","title":"","target":"_blank","internal":false}},{"image":{"src":"https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/app\/assets-bpce\/uploads\/sites\/17\/2023\/03\/entite-natixis-interepargne-2.png","alt":"Lien pour acc\u00e9der au site de Natixis Interepargne"},"link":{"url":"https:\/\/www.interepargne.natixis.com","title":"","target":"_blank","internal":false}},{"image":{"src":"https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/app\/assets-bpce\/uploads\/sites\/17\/2023\/03\/entite-mirova-1.png","alt":"Lien pour acc\u00e9der au site de Mirova"},"link":{"url":"https:\/\/www.mirova.com\/fr","title":"","target":"_blank","internal":false}},{"image":{"src":"https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/app\/assets-bpce\/uploads\/sites\/17\/2023\/03\/entite-iml-2.png","alt":"Lien pour acc\u00e9der au site de IML"},"link":{"url":"https:\/\/www.iml.com.au\/","title":"","target":"_blank","internal":false}},{"image":{"src":"https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/app\/assets-bpce\/uploads\/sites\/17\/2023\/03\/entite-ostrum.png","alt":"Lien pour acc\u00e9der au site d'Ostrum"},"link":{"url":"https:\/\/www.ostrum.com\/fr","title":"","target":"_blank","internal":false}},{"image":{"src":"https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/app\/assets-bpce\/uploads\/sites\/17\/2026\/05\/logo-wcm.png","alt":"Lien pour acc\u00e9der au site de WCM Investment Management"},"link":{"url":"http:\/\/www.wcminvest.com\/","title":"","target":"_blank","internal":false}},{"image":{"src":"https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/app\/assets-bpce\/uploads\/sites\/17\/2026\/05\/logo-harris.png","alt":"Lien pour acc\u00e9der au site de Harris Oakmark"},"link":{"url":"https:\/\/harrisassoc.com\/","title":"","target":"_blank","internal":false}},{"image":{"src":"https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/app\/assets-bpce\/uploads\/sites\/17\/2023\/03\/entite-vaughan-nelson.png","alt":"Lien pour acc\u00e9der au site de Vaughan Nelson"},"link":{"url":"https:\/\/www.vaughannelson.com\/about\/firm","title":"","target":"_blank","internal":false}},{"image":{"src":"https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/app\/assets-bpce\/uploads\/sites\/17\/2023\/03\/entite-loomis.png","alt":"Lien pour acc\u00e9der au site de Loomis"},"link":{"url":"https:\/\/www.loomissayles.com","title":"","target":"_blank","internal":false}},{"image":{"src":"https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/app\/assets-bpce\/uploads\/sites\/17\/2023\/03\/entite-dorval-1.png","alt":"Lien pour acc\u00e9der au site de Dorval"},"link":{"url":"https:\/\/www.dorval-am.com\/","title":"","target":"_blank","internal":false}},{"image":{"src":"https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/app\/assets-bpce\/uploads\/sites\/17\/2023\/03\/entite-dnca.png","alt":"Lien pour acc\u00e9der au site de DNCA Investments"},"link":{"url":"https:\/\/www.dnca-investments.com\/","title":"","target":"_blank","internal":false}},{"image":{"src":"https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/app\/assets-bpce\/uploads\/sites\/17\/2023\/03\/entite-AEW.png","alt":"Lien pour acc\u00e9der au site de AEW"},"link":{"url":"https:\/\/www.aewpatrimoine.com\/","title":"","target":"_blank","internal":false}},{"image":{"src":"https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/app\/assets-bpce\/uploads\/sites\/17\/2023\/03\/entite-seventure.png","alt":"Lien pour acc\u00e9der au site de Seventure"},"link":{"url":"http:\/\/www.seventure.fr","title":"","target":"_blank","internal":false}},{"image":{"src":"https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/app\/assets-bpce\/uploads\/sites\/17\/2023\/03\/entite-vauban.png","alt":"Lien pour acc\u00e9der au site de Vauban Infrastructure Partners"},"link":{"url":"https:\/\/vauban-ip.com\/fr\/","title":"","target":"_blank","internal":false}},{"image":{"src":"https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/app\/assets-bpce\/uploads\/sites\/17\/2023\/03\/entite-flexstone.png","alt":"Lien pour acc\u00e9der au site de Flexstone Partners"},"link":{"url":"https:\/\/www.flexstonepartners.com","title":"","target":"_blank","internal":false}},{"image":{"src":"https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/app\/assets-bpce\/uploads\/sites\/17\/2023\/03\/entite-naxicap.png","alt":"Lien pour acc\u00e9der au site de Naxicap Partners"},"link":{"url":"https:\/\/naxicap.com\/","title":"","target":"_blank","internal":false}},{"image":{"src":"https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/app\/assets-bpce\/uploads\/sites\/17\/2023\/03\/entite-ossiam.png","alt":"Lien pour acc\u00e9der au site de Ossiam"},"link":{"url":"https:\/\/www.ossiam.com\/","title":"","target":"_blank","internal":false}},{"image":{"src":"https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/app\/assets-bpce\/uploads\/sites\/17\/2023\/03\/entite-frenchurch.png","alt":"Lien pour acc\u00e9der au site de Frenchurch Advisory"},"link":{"url":"https:\/\/www.fenchurchadvisory.com\/","title":"","target":"_blank","internal":false}},{"image":{"src":"https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/app\/assets-bpce\/uploads\/sites\/17\/2023\/03\/entite-solomon-1.png","alt":"Lien pour acc\u00e9der au site de Solomon Partners"},"link":{"url":"https:\/\/solomonpartners.com\/","title":"","target":"_blank","internal":false}}]}},{"_uid":"8718cf204b0f4","bloc":"bloc_texte_image","datas":{"image":{"src":"https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/app\/assets-bpce\/uploads\/sites\/17\/2023\/04\/rejoignez-nous-02.jpg","alt":""},"position":"left","text":"<h2 style=\"text-align: left\"><strong>Rejoignez-nous<\/strong> pour faire la diff\u00e9rence<\/h2>\n<p>Vous contribuerez \u00e0 la construction de solutions de financement et d\u2019investissement durables. Nous vous apportons notre engagement, vous nous apportez votre vision et votre audace au service de l\u2019intelligence collective.<\/p>\n<p>Donnez \u00e0 nos clients les moyens d&rsquo;avoir un impact positif sur le monde.<\/p>\n<p><a class=\"bouton\" href=\"https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/app\/assets-bpce\/uploads\/sites\/17\/2026\/02\/30012026-brochure-evp-fr.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Acc\u00e9der \u00e0 la brochure<\/a><\/p>\n"}},{"_uid":"ee97a0a547896","bloc":"bloc_texte_image","datas":{"image":{"src":"https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/app\/assets-bpce\/uploads\/sites\/17\/2023\/04\/Cecile-tricon-bossard_photo-redimensionnee-en-QUALIF.jpg","alt":""},"position":"left","text":"<h2 style=\"text-align: left\"><strong>Vous allez aimer<\/strong> travailler chez nous!<\/h2>\n<p>Nous souhaitons construire un environnement de travail inclusif et performant, o\u00f9 chacun(e) peut d\u00e9velopper ses comp\u00e9tences, \u00eatre acteur\/actrice des transformations et avoir un impact positif sur son activit\u00e9 et le monde qui l\u2019entoure.<\/p>\n<p>Nos talents sont notre atout le plus pr\u00e9cieux, quand ils grandissent, nous grandissons, et c&rsquo;est ce qui nous permet de faire la diff\u00e9rence aupr\u00e8s de nos clients.<\/p>\n<p><strong>C\u00e9cile Tricon Bossard,<\/strong><br \/>\nDirectrice des ressources humaines de Natixis<\/p>\n"}},{"_uid":"8a5f30bfa6647","bloc":"bloc_wysiwyg","datas":{"text":"<div class=\"pourquoi\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center\">Pourquoi nous rejoindre<\/h2>\n<div class=\"colonnes quatre\">\n<div class=\"colonne international\" style=\"text-align: center\">\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/app\/assets-bpce\/uploads\/sites\/17\/2023\/03\/icone-international.svg\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" \/><\/p>\n<h3>International<\/h3>\n<p>Faites partie d\u2019une communaut\u00e9 multiculturelle qui vous donnera de formidables occasions d\u2019avancer, d\u2019\u00e9changer et de travailler pour relever les grands d\u00e9fis de notre \u00e9poque.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"colonne excellence\" style=\"text-align: center\">\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/app\/assets-bpce\/uploads\/sites\/17\/2023\/03\/icone-excellence.svg\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" \/><\/p>\n<h3>Excellence<\/h3>\n<p>B\u00e9n\u00e9ficiez d\u2019un cadre de travail o\u00f9 vous apprendrez chaque jour aux c\u00f4t\u00e9s des meilleurs experts dans leur domaine. D\u00e9veloppez ainsi vos comp\u00e9tences et enrichissez en permanence votre r\u00e9seau.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"colonne humain\" style=\"text-align: center\">\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/app\/assets-bpce\/uploads\/sites\/17\/2023\/03\/icone-facteur-humain.svg\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" \/><\/p>\n<h3>Facteur humain<\/h3>\n<p>Devenez un membre \u00e0 part enti\u00e8re d\u2019un \u00e9cosyst\u00e8me \u00e0 taille humaine o\u00f9 prime un esprit entrepreneurial et collectif.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"colonne durable\" style=\"text-align: center\">\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/recrutement.natixis.com\/app\/assets-bpce\/uploads\/sites\/17\/2023\/03\/icone-impact-durable.svg\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" \/><\/p>\n<h3>Impact<\/h3>\n<p>Accompagnez nos entreprises et nos clients dans leurs d\u00e9fis, en proposant des solutions innovantes et durables.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n"}}]},"jobs_offer":{"filters":{"items":[{"title":"Entreprise","id":"tax_brands","choices":[{"label":"AEW","value":"aew"},{"label":"AEW Europe Italian Branch","value":"aew-europe-italian-branch"},{"label":"BPCE Equipment Finance Hungary Plc","value":"bpce-equipment-finance-hungary-plc"},{"label":"BPCE Equipment Solutions SAS","value":"bpce-equipment-solutions-sas"},{"label":"GEFA Direkt GmbH","value":"gefa-direkt-gmbh"},{"label":"Mirova","value":"mirova"},{"label":"Natixis CIB Asia Pacific","value":"natixis-cib-asia-pacific"},{"label":"Natixis CIB Australia","value":"natixis-cib-australia"},{"label":"Natixis CIB Duba\u00ef","value":"natixis-cib-dubai"},{"label":"Natixis CIB France","value":"natixis-cib-france"},{"label":"Natixis CIB Hong Kong","value":"natixis-cib-hong-kong"},{"label":"Natixis CIB London","value":"natixis-cib-london"},{"label":"Natixis CIB Luxembourg","value":"natixis-cib-luxembourg"},{"label":"Natixis CIB Milan","value":"natixis-cib-milan"},{"label":"Natixis CIB New York","value":"natixis-cib-new-york"},{"label":"Natixis CIB North America","value":"natixis-cib-north-america"},{"label":"Natixis CIB Taipei","value":"natixis-cib-taipei"},{"label":"Natixis IM Operating Services","value":"natixis-im-operating-services"},{"label":"Natixis IM UK Limited","value":"natixis-im-uk-limited"},{"label":"Natixis Inter\u00e9pargne","value":"natixis-interepargne"},{"label":"Natixis Invest. Managers Inter","value":"natixis-invest-managers-inter"},{"label":"Natixis Investment Managers","value":"natixis-investment-managers"},{"label":"Natixis Madrid Branch","value":"natixis-madrid-branch"},{"label":"Natixis - Singapore - DBU","value":"natixis-singapore-dbu"},{"label":"Natixis TradEx Solutions","value":"natixis-tradex-solutions"},{"label":"Natixis Wealth Management","value":"natixis-wealth-management"},{"label":"NIMI, Luxembourg branch","value":"nimi-luxembourg-branch"},{"label":"NIMI, Nordics Filial","value":"nimi-nordics-filial"},{"label":"NIMI, succursale Italiana","value":"nimi-succursale-italiana"},{"label":"Ostrum Asset Management","value":"ostrum-asset-management"},{"label":"Philips Medical Capital France","value":"philips-medical-capital-france"},{"label":"Teora","value":"teora"},{"label":"VEGA Investment Solutions","value":"vega-investment-solutions"}]},{"title":"Type de contrat","id":"tax_contract","choices":[{"label":"Alternance","value":"contrat-en-alternance"},{"label":"CDD","value":"cdd"},{"label":"CDI","value":"cdi"},{"label":"Stage","value":"stage"},{"label":"VIE","value":"vie"}]},{"title":"Localisation","id":"tax_country","choices":[{"label":"France","value":"france"},{"label":"International","value":"international"}]},{"title":"R\u00e9gion","id":"tax_place","choices":[{"label":"Allemagne","value":"allemagne"},{"label":"Australie","value":"australie"},{"label":"Auvergne-Rh\u00f4ne-Alpes","value":"auvergne-rhone-alpes"},{"label":"\u00c9mirats Arabes Unis","value":"emirats-arabes-unis"},{"label":"Espagne","value":"espagne"},{"label":"\u00c9tats-Unis","value":"etats-unis"},{"label":"Hong Kong","value":"hong-kong"},{"label":"Ile-de-France","value":"ile-de-france"},{"label":"Italie","value":"italie"},{"label":"Korea, Republic of","value":"korea-republic-of"},{"label":"Luxembourg","value":"luxembourg"},{"label":"Normandie","value":"normandie"},{"label":"Nouvelle-Aquitaine","value":"nouvelle-aquitaine"},{"label":"Provence-Alpes-C\u00f4te d'Azur","value":"provence-alpes-cote-dazur"},{"label":"Royaume-Uni","value":"royaume-uni"},{"label":"Singapour","value":"singapour"},{"label":"Su\u00e8de","value":"suede"},{"label":"Taiwan","value":"taiwan"}]},{"title":"Ville","id":"tax_city","choices":[{"label":"Bordeaux","value":"bordeaux"},{"label":"Caen","value":"caen"},{"label":"Charenton le pont","value":"charenton-le-pont"},{"label":"Duba\u00ef","value":"dubai"},{"label":"Halle","value":"halle"},{"label":"Hong Kong","value":"hong-kong"},{"label":"Londres","value":"londres"},{"label":"Luxembourg","value":"luxembourg"},{"label":"Lyon","value":"lyon"},{"label":"Madrid","value":"madrid"},{"label":"Marseille","value":"marseille"},{"label":"Milan","value":"milan"},{"label":"New York","value":"new-york"},{"label":"Paris","value":"paris"},{"label":"Puteaux","value":"puteaux"},{"label":"Seoul","value":"seoul"},{"label":"Stockholm","value":"stockholm"},{"label":"Sydney","value":"sydney"},{"label":"Taipei","value":"taipei"}]}]},"jobs":{"total_multiple":"poste(s) \u00e0 pourvoir","total_single":"poste(s) \u00e0 pourvoir","btn_see_more":"Voir plus","no_results":"Aucun r\u00e9sultat pour votre recherche","loading":"Chargement...","list":{"post_id":19534,"job_number":"20948","advert_id":"20948","opening_id":"20948","modification_date":1778652625,"technical_id":["CHANNELNATIXIS"],"liked":false,"title":"Front Office IT Support Business Analyst","date":"2026-05-13","datetime":"2026-05-13 06:10:","timestamp":1778652625,"sector":["Informatique"],"job":["Business analyst"],"jobcode":"OIX02","jobcode_bpce":"","brand":["Natixis CIB North America"],"contract":["CDI"],"degree":[],"experience":[],"description":"<br><h2 class=\"job_subtitle\">Poste et missions<\/h2><br><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(35, 35, 35); font-family: \"Ubuntu Regular\", sans-serif, serif; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-size: 14px; font-stretch: inherit; font-style: normal; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 1.4rem; margin: 4px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-decoration-color: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px;\"><strong>Join Our Dynamic Global Markets IT Team as a Front Office Business Analyst!<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(35, 35, 35); font-family: \"Ubuntu Regular\", sans-serif, serif; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-size: 14px; font-stretch: inherit; font-style: normal; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 1.4rem; margin: 4px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-decoration-color: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px;\">Are you passionate about the intersection of finance and technology? Do you thrive in fast-paced environments supporting critical trading operations? Our Global Markets Business Support and Monitoring IT team is seeking a talented <strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \"Ubuntu Bold\", sans-serif, serif; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit;\">Front Office IT Business Analyst<\/strong> to join us.<\/p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(35, 35, 35); font-family: \"Ubuntu Regular\", sans-serif, serif; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-size: 14px; font-stretch: inherit; font-style: normal; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 1.4rem; margin: 4px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-decoration-color: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px;\">\u00a0<\/p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(35, 35, 35); font-family: \"Ubuntu Regular\", sans-serif, serif; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-size: 14px; font-stretch: inherit; font-style: normal; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 1.4rem; margin: 4px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-decoration-color: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px;\">You'll be at the heart of our success, providing vital Level 1 functional and technical support for the applications used by our Equity Derivatives, Securities Lending, Global Macro (Rates, FX, Commodities), and Credit Front Office and Support Functions teams. This is a unique opportunity to make a tangible impact on trading efficiency and innovation.<\/p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(35, 35, 35); font-family: \"Ubuntu Regular\", sans-serif, serif; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-size: 14px; font-stretch: inherit; font-style: normal; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 1.4rem; margin: 4px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-decoration-color: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px;\">\u00a0<\/p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(35, 35, 35); font-family: \"Ubuntu Regular\", sans-serif, serif; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-size: 14px; font-stretch: inherit; font-style: normal; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 1.4rem; margin: 4px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-decoration-color: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px;\"><strong>What You'll Do:<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(35, 35, 35); font-family: \"Ubuntu Regular\", sans-serif, serif; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-size: 14px; font-stretch: inherit; font-style: normal; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 1.4rem; margin: 4px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-decoration-color: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px;\">As a key member of our team, you'll be instrumental in supporting cutting-edge applications for trade booking, integrating with external execution platforms via trade gateways, and ensuring accurate Trace reporting. While a primary focus will be on Level 1 functional support, you'll also dive deep into Business Analysis, playing a crucial role in implementing exciting new features for our supported applications. You'll collaborate closely with our Front Office teams and support functions, leveraging your keen understanding of financial products.<\/p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(35, 35, 35); font-family: \"Ubuntu Regular\", sans-serif, serif; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-size: 14px; font-stretch: inherit; font-style: normal; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 1.4rem; margin: 4px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-decoration-color: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px;\">\u00a0<\/p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><strong>Your Impact Will Include:<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"><li><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><strong>Become a Trusted Partner:<\/strong>\u00a0Forge strong relationships with traders by working directly with their desks to understand their needs.<\/span><\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><strong>Ensure Operational Excellence:<\/strong>\u00a0Address user support requests and manage incidents with efficiency and effectiveness, ensuring timely resolutions.<\/span><\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><strong>Drive Innovation:<\/strong>\u00a0Gather business requirements from traders and stakeholders, translating their vision into actionable improvements for our applications.<\/span><\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><strong>Champion Quality:<\/strong>\u00a0Conduct thorough testing of new features, bug fixes, and system updates to guarantee they meet business objectives and perform flawlessly.<\/span><\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><strong>Empower Users:<\/strong>\u00a0Provide comprehensive training and create clear, concise user guides to enhance application adoption and proficiency.<\/span><\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><strong>Bridge Development and Business:<\/strong>\u00a0Act as a liaison between user needs and IT Development teams, facilitating clear communication and effective prioritization for feature implementation.<\/span><\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><strong>Proactive Monitoring:<\/strong>\u00a0Monitor application performance to identify and proactively resolve issues, ensuring a seamless user experience and optimal operational efficiency.<\/span><\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><strong>Communicate Effectively:<\/strong>\u00a0Provide regular, clear updates on support activities, requests, and project statuses to stakeholders and management.<\/span><\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><strong>Understand the Business:<\/strong>\u00a0Deeply engage with Front Office teams to understand their workflows, solicit feedback, and identify key areas for enhancement.<\/span><\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><strong>Uphold Standards:<\/strong>\u00a0Ensure all support activities align with internal policies and industry best practices.<\/span><\/span><\/li><\/ul><p>\u00a0<\/p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><strong>What You'll Bring:<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"><li><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\">A Bachelor's Degree in Computer Science or Finance.<\/span><\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\">Proven experience in IT business analysis and\/or IT Support Analyst roles within a Front Office environment in the Finance industry.<\/span><\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\">Solid knowledge of at least two of the following: Credit Bonds, CLOs, or Repos.<\/span><\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\">Familiarity with one or more of these domains: Trade and booking gateways, electronic trading, financial modeling and analysis tools, or intraday risks and P&L.<\/span><\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><strong>Exceptional Communication Skills:<\/strong>\u00a0Ability to articulate technical concepts clearly and build rapport with diverse stakeholders.<\/span><\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><strong>Agility & Adaptability:<\/strong>\u00a0Proven ability to quickly prioritize tasks and multi-task effectively in a fast-paced, dynamic environment supporting multiple applications.<\/span><\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><strong>Client-Centric Approach:<\/strong>\u00a0A strong commitment to delivering outstanding customer service.<\/span><\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><strong>Sharp Analytical Mind:<\/strong>\u00a0Excellent problem-solving and analytical capabilities.<\/span><\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><strong>Technical Aptitude:<\/strong>\u00a0Knowledge of C# (or a similar programming language) is a significant advantage.<\/span><\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><strong>Precision:<\/strong>\u00a0A detail-oriented approach, coupled with strong organizational skills.<\/span><\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><strong>Collaborative Spirit:<\/strong>\u00a0Strong interpersonal skills to foster teamwork and positive working relationships.<\/span><\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><strong>Bonus Points:<\/strong>\u00a0Familiarity with Agile practices and methodologies<\/span><\/span><\/li><\/ul><p>\u00a0<\/p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(35, 35, 35); font-family: \"Ubuntu Regular\", sans-serif, serif; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-size: 14px; font-stretch: inherit; font-style: normal; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 1.4rem; margin: 4px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-decoration-color: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px;\"><strong>Why Join Us?<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(35, 35, 35); font-family: \"Ubuntu Regular\", sans-serif, serif; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-size: 14px; font-stretch: inherit; font-style: normal; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 1.4rem; margin: 4px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-decoration-color: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px;\">This is your chance to be part of a leading global financial institution, working with sophisticated financial products. You'll have the opportunity to grow your career, develop your skills, and make a real difference in a supportive and innovative environment.<\/p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(35, 35, 35); font-family: \"Ubuntu Regular\", sans-serif, serif; font-feature-settings: inhe